  "releaseNotes": "SharpVision.Document 1.6.0-beta.6 prerelease: version-aligned with the other SharpVision packages; no functional changes since 1.6.0-beta.2, in which Document selection started to take part in the application-wide single text selection introduced in SharpVision 1.6.0-beta.2: selecting in a Document collapses ranges held by other owners and vice versa. Since 1.6.0-beta.1 the Document control derives from the core ScrollableCompositeControlBase and uses the shared ProjectionSurface, scroll-bridge, glyph-resolution, and style-span merging seams introduced in SharpVision 1.6.0-beta.1, replacing its own DocumentSurface and hand-rolled copies; no public behavior change.",
